{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415737","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415737","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041573701:1":{"text":"仇恨有时比信念更简单。","source_cn":"仇恨有时比信念更简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC192BFF202A0F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573702:1":{"text":"它像一把不会钝的剑，让你无需思考，只需挥砍。","source_cn":"它像一把不会钝的剑，让你无需思考，只需挥砍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643FDD64A1A00E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573703:1":{"text":"直到砍到不该砍的东西，比如呼临城的未来。","source_cn":"直到砍到不该砍的东西，比如呼临城的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F8807DEFDBCEB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573704:1":{"text":"统帅阁下，你真正恐惧的，是放下这把剑之后的迷茫吧？","source_cn":"统帅阁下，你真正恐惧的，是放下这把剑之后的迷茫吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ACBF45660D352D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573705:1":{"text":"我分不清了。","source_cn":"我分不清了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC4C98A26804866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573706:1":{"text":"当我下令开战时，眼前时而